# Theme Studio & modern visuals (locked)

Docs: `docs/THEME_STUDIO.md` · reference: [designmd Build](https://designmd.santiagoalonso.com/build?cat=Dev+Tools%2CSaaS&sort=popular)

## Theme Studio
- Ship a **custom theme generator** (parity with designmd remix): palette, type, buttons, forms, cards, elevation, alerts, tabs, stats, table, nav… live preview + export (`theme.ts` / CSS vars / SCSS).
- Official six themes stay **read-only**; custom themes via CSS-var overlay (`ThemeService.applyCustom`), `vp-` prefix, no full remount flash.
- Preview uses real `@amg-webui` base components, not static mocks.
- Code under `packages/theme/studio/` · example page `theme-custom` (`group: 'theme'`).

## Visual bar (anti–generic admin)
- Product surfaces (bg / surface / elevated), purposeful type scale, restraint motion.
- **Avoid**: dead-gray heavy borders, purple-gradient cliché, stuffing first viewport with dash cards, hardcoded hex/px.
- Keep SPEC/TOKENS; Studio only edits allowed Token axes.

## When building UI
Prefer modern SaaS/dev-tools language over traditional ERP chrome; still honor Inverted-L shell + density rules in SPEC.
